A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1124198/000162828025005924/flr-20241231.htm"},{"firm":"Jacobs Solutions","cik":52988,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000005298824000065/jec-20240927.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761525000018/kbr-20250103.htm"},{"firm":"Aecom","cik":868857,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/868857/000086885725000013/acm-20250930.htm"},{"firm":"Fluor","cik":1124198,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1124198/000112419826000007/flr-20251231.htm"},{"firm":"Jacobs Solutions","cik":52988,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000162828025053316/jec-20250926.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761526000051/kbr-20260102.htm"}]},{"id":10,"n_firms":4,"n_passages":7,"first_year":2024,"last_year":2025,"segments":["Engineering services","Heavy construction"],"text":"Additionally, the laws and regulations concerning the use of AI continue to evolve.","uses":[{"firm":"Fluor","cik":1124198,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1124198/000162828025005924/flr-20241231.htm"},{"firm":"Jacobs Solutions","cik":52988,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000005298824000065/jec-20240927.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761525000018/kbr-20250103.htm"},{"firm":"Aecom","cik":868857,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/868857/000086885725000013/acm-20250930.htm"},{"firm":"Fluor","cik":1124198,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1124198/000112419826000007/flr-20251231.htm"},{"firm":"Jacobs Solutions","cik":52988,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000162828025053316/jec-20250926.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761526000051/kbr-20260102.htm"}]},{"id":5,"n_firms":4,"n_passages":6,"first_year":2024,"last_year":2025,"segments":["Engineering services","Heavy construction"],"text":"Artificial intelligence, machine learning, data science and similar technologies (collectively, \u201cAI\u201d), including third-party AI tools, may be enabled by, or integrated into, some of our business processes and solutions.","uses":[{"firm":"Fluor","cik":1124198,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1124198/000162828025005924/flr-20241231.htm"},{"firm":"Jacobs Solutions","cik":52988,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000005298824000065/jec-20240927.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761525000018/kbr-20250103.htm"},{"firm":"Aecom","cik":868857,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/868857/000086885725000013/acm-20250930.htm"},{"firm":"Fluor","cik":1124198,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1124198/000112419826000007/flr-20251231.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761526000051/kbr-20260102.htm"}]},{"id":188,"n_firms":4,"n_passages":6,"first_year":2023,"last_year":2025,"segments":["Heavy construction","Special trade contractors"],"text":"In addition, the rapid evolution and increased adoption of artificial intelligence technologies may intensify our cybersecurity risks .","uses":[{"firm":"Jacobs Solutions","cik":52988,"fy":2023,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000005298823000084/jec-20230929.htm"},{"firm":"Limbach","cik":1606163,"fy":2023,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1606163/000162828024010995/lmb-20231231.htm"},{"firm":"Shimmick","cik":1887944,"fy":2023,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1887944/000095017024038024/shim-20231229.htm"},{"firm":"MasTec","cik":15615,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/15615/000001561525000021/mtz-20241231.htm"},{"firm":"MasTec","cik":15615,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/15615/000001561526000020/mtz-20251231.htm"},{"firm":"Shimmick","cik":1887944,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1887944/000119312526105064/shim-20260102.htm"}]},{"id":31,"n_firms":3,"n_passages":7,"first_year":2023,"last_year":2025,"segments":["General building contractors"],"text":"AI programs can incur significant costs and demand substantial expertise for development, pose challenges in setup and management, and necessitate periodic updates.","uses":[{"firm":"Dream Finders Homes","cik":1825088,"fy":2023,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1825088/000182508824000015/dfh-20231231.htm"},{"firm":"Beazer Homes USA","cik":915840,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/915840/000091584024000069/bzh-20240930.htm"},{"firm":"Dream Finders Homes","cik":1825088,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1825088/000182508825000014/dfh-20241231.htm"},{"firm":"Green Brick Partners","cik":1373670,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1373670/000137367025000007/grbk-20241231.htm"},{"firm":"Beazer Homes USA","cik":915840,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/915840/000091584025000075/bzh-20250930.htm"},{"firm":"Dream Finders Homes","cik":1825088,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1825088/000162828026010837/dfh-20251231.htm"},{"firm":"Green Brick Partners","cik":1373670,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1373670/000162828026011798/grbk-20251231.htm"}]},{"id":153,"n_firms":3,"n_passages":4,"first_year":2024,"last_year":2025,"segments":["Heavy construction"],"text":"Datasets used to train or develop AI systems may be insufficient, of inferior quality, or contain biased information.","uses":[{"firm":"Fluor","cik":1124198,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1124198/000162828025005924/flr-20241231.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761525000018/kbr-20250103.htm"},{"firm":"Jacobs Solutions","cik":52988,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000162828025053316/jec-20250926.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761526000051/kbr-20260102.htm"}]},{"id":30,"n_firms":2,"n_passages":4,"first_year":2023,"last_year":2025,"segments":["General building contractors"],"text":"It is conceivable that we might integrate further AI solutions into our information systems in the future, potentially assuming a more critical role in our operations over time.","uses":[{"firm":"Dream Finders Homes","cik":1825088,"fy":2023,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1825088/000182508824000015/dfh-20231231.htm"},{"firm":"Beazer Homes USA","cik":915840,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/915840/000091584024000069/bzh-20240930.htm"},{"firm":"Dream Finders Homes","cik":1825088,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1825088/000182508825000014/dfh-20241231.htm"},{"firm":"Dream Finders Homes","cik":1825088,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1825088/000162828026010837/dfh-20251231.htm"}]},{"id":117,"n_firms":2,"n_passages":4,"first_year":2023,"last_year":2025,"segments":["General building contractors"],"text":"Competitors or other entities may integrate AI into their information systems and business operations more swiftly or effectively than us, potentially impairing our competitive edge and negatively impacting our financial performance.","uses":[{"firm":"Dream Finders Homes","cik":1825088,"fy":2023,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1825088/000182508824000015/dfh-20231231.htm"},{"firm":"Dream Finders Homes","cik":1825088,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1825088/000182508825000014/dfh-20241231.htm"},{"firm":"Dream Finders Homes","cik":1825088,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1825088/000162828026010837/dfh-20251231.htm"},{"firm":"Green Brick Partners","cik":1373670,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1373670/000162828026011798/grbk-20251231.htm"}]},{"id":197,"n_firms":2,"n_passages":4,"first_year":2024,"last_year":2025,"segments":["Heavy construction"],"text":"If the use or integration of AI systems, or the outputs generated by such systems, were determined to be non-compliant (e.g., in relation to intellectual property or data privacy rights), this may result in liability, including legal liability, or adversely affect our business, reputation, brand, financial condition and results of operations.","uses":[{"firm":"Jacobs Solutions","cik":52988,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000005298824000065/jec-20240927.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761525000018/kbr-20250103.htm"},{"firm":"Jacobs Solutions","cik":52988,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000162828025053316/jec-20250926.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761526000051/kbr-20260102.htm"}]},{"id":198,"n_firms":2,"n_passages":4,"first_year":2024,"last_year":2025,"segments":["Heavy construction"],"text":"It is possible that emerging regulations may limit or block the use of AI in our business and solutions or otherwise impose other restrictions that may affect or impair the usability or efficiency of our business or services for an extended period of time or indefinitely.","uses":[{"firm":"Jacobs Solutions","cik":52988,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000005298824000065/jec-20240927.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761525000018/kbr-20250103.htm"},{"firm":"Jacobs Solutions","cik":52988,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000162828025053316/jec-20250926.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761526000051/kbr-20260102.htm"}]},{"id":199,"n_firms":2,"n_passages":4,"first_year":2024,"last_year":2025,"segments":["Heavy construction"],"text":"Our competitors or other third parties may incorporate AI into their product development, product offerings, technology and infrastructure products more quickly or more 21 successfully than us, which could impair our ability to compete effectively and adversely affect our business, financial condition and results of operations.","uses":[{"firm":"Jacobs Solutions","cik":52988,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000005298824000065/jec-20240927.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761525000018/kbr-20250103.htm"},{"firm":"Jacobs Solutions","cik":52988,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/52988/000162828025053316/jec-20250926.htm"},{"firm":"KBR","cik":1357615,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1357615/000135761526000051/kbr-20260102.htm"}]},{"id":13,"n_firms":2,"n_passages":3,"first_year":2024,"last_year":2025,"segments":["Engineering services","Heavy construction"],"text":"Our competitors or other third parties may incorporate AI into their product and service offerings more quickly or more successfully than us, which could impair our ability to compete effectively and adversely affect our business, financial condition and results of operations.","uses":[{"firm":"Fluor","cik":1124198,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1124198/000162828025005924/flr-20241231.htm"},{"firm":"Aecom","cik":868857,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/868857/000086885725000013/acm-20250930.htm"},{"firm":"Fluor","cik":1124198,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1124198/000112419826000007/flr-20251231.htm"}]},{"id":165,"n_firms":2,"n_passages":3,"first_year":2024,"last_year":2025,"segments":["General building contractors","Heavy construction"],"text":"Additionally, the increased prevalence and use of artificial intelligence may heighten the risk that we may be subject to cybersecurity incidents in the future.","uses":[{"firm":"Granite Construction","cik":861459,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/861459/000086145925000007/gva-20241231.htm"},{"firm":"Granite Construction","cik":861459,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/861459/000086145926000004/gva-20251231.htm"},{"firm":"Tutor Perini","cik":77543,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/77543/000007754326000028/tpc-20251231.htm"}]},{"id":183,"n_firms":2,"n_passages":3,"first_year":2024,"last_year":2025,"segments":["General building contractors"],"text":"In addition, cybersecurity risk is exacerbated with the advancement of technologies like artificial intelligence, which malicious third parties are using to create new, sophisticated and more frequent attacks.","uses":[{"firm":"LGI Homes","cik":1580670,"fy":2024,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1580670/000158067025000016/lgih-20241231.htm"},{"firm":"Hovnanian Enterprises","cik":357294,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1 Business","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/357294/000175392625001938/hov-20251031.htm"},{"firm":"LGI Homes","cik":1580670,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1580670/000158067026000019/lgih-20251231.htm"}]},{"id":36,"n_firms":2,"n_passages":2,"first_year":2025,"last_year":2025,"segments":["General building contractors"],"text":"In addition, the AI-related legal and regulatory landscape is constantly evolving and therefore remains uncertain and may be inconsistent from jurisdiction to jurisdiction.","uses":[{"firm":"Beazer Homes USA","cik":915840,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/915840/000091584025000075/bzh-20250930.htm"},{"firm":"Green Brick Partners","cik":1373670,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1373670/000162828026011798/grbk-20251231.htm"}]},{"id":37,"n_firms":2,"n_passages":2,"first_year":2025,"last_year":2025,"segments":["General building contractors"],"text":"Our obligations to comply with the evolving legal and regulatory landscape could entail significant costs or limit our ability to incorporate certain AI capabilities into our operations.","uses":[{"firm":"Beazer Homes USA","cik":915840,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/915840/000091584025000075/bzh-20250930.htm"},{"firm":"Green Brick Partners","cik":1373670,"fy":2025,"section":"Item 1A Risk Factors","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1373670/000162828026011798/grbk-20251231.htm"}]}]